<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair Sept load factor down to 72.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Swissair Sept load factor down to 72.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair Schweizerische Luftverkehr AG said its overall load factor eased to 72.6 percent in September from 73.3 percent in September 1995.</p>
<p>Swissair gave the following details:</p>
<p>					 Sept 1996     Sept 1995</p>
<p> Overall load factor		 72.6 pct     73.3 pct</p>
<p> Seat load factor		    70.6 pct     71.7 pct</p>
<p> Passengers carried		  805,195	799,247</p>
<p> Available tonne-km (thousands)  468,791	432,140</p>
<p>Revenue tonne-km (thousands)</p>
<p>    total				340,369	316,812</p>
<p>    passenger			  199,263	185,743</p>
<p>    cargo/mail			 141,106	131,069</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
